### 3. Create product with a missing category (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Dress",
  "price": 300,
  "stock": 2,
  "categoryId": 999
}

### 4. Create product with an existing category (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Silk Evening Dress",
  "price": 450,
  "stock": 5,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### 5. Move a product to a missing category (expect 400)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/PRODUCT_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 999
}